    {
      "id": "daemon-lifecycle",
      "title": "Starting, idling and autostart",
      "summary": "The server's idle exit, the stale-socket handling, the CLI's serve path and the client's autostart are unit-tested; the smoke test checks the invoker's autostart.",
      "subject": [
        {
          "path": "macos/rust/zazzled/src/.dev/operation.json",
