          "path": "macos/rust/zazzled/src/.dev/use-case.json",
          "entityId": "use-over-mcp"
        }
      ],
      "criteria": [
        "The server exits once idle, but not while a connection is open, and removes the socket it bound.",
        "A live daemon on the socket is refused; a stale socket is cleared.",
        "ZAZZLE_IDLE_SECS sets the default idle time and a bad value is ignored.",
        "The client starts the daemon when none listens, retries, and gives up after its deadline.",
        "A daemon the invoker starts does not keep the caller's standard output open."
      ],
      "checks": [
